7. Precautions

1. Check all circuit connections before switching on the power supply.
2. Apply all input combinations carefully.
3. Observe the output indicators properly.
4. Record the outputs accurately.

8. Observation

The outputs for all possible input combinations were observed and recorded for each logic gate.

9. Result

The truth tables of AND, OR, NOT, NOR, NAND, EX-OR and EX-NOR gates were verified and interpreted successfully.
